# WorkHub Environment Configuration Overview
# The platform is structured as a decoupled full-stack MERN application.
# Configure environment variables in their respective sub-directories:

# 1. Server Configuration: server/.env
#    - PORT=5000
#    - MONGODB_URI=mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/workhub
#    - JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret
#    - CLIENT_URL=http://localhost:5173

# 2. Client Configuration: client/.env
#    - VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
#    - VITE_SOCKET_URL=/

